# Keep line endings identical on every OS. A CRLF shell script breaks on GitLab's Linux runners,
# and CRLF vs LF changes file hashes (and so the dataset id shown in reports).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.zip binary
